<title>HONG KONG: Nanyang interim net jumps sharply.</title>
<headline>Nanyang interim net jumps sharply.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   118.0     vs 18.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	 vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  70.6 gain vs 1.1 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    58.9	vs 8.8</p>
<p>    Turnover		     133.8     vs 114.8</p>
<p>    Company name		 Nanyang Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Yarn and garment manufacturer Nanyang Holdings also engages in property investments.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on disposal of properties for sale.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
